     Starting August 14, Matt Welsh, coordinator of the Linux
Documentation Project and author of our book, _Running Linux_
will undertake an 11-city North American Linux tour.  The 
August dates, times, and locations follow.  (We are still
finalizing the September tour dates; I'll post them as soon
as they are firm.  The cities tentatively scheduled include
Edmonton, Calgary, Toronto, New York, and Releigh/Durham.)

AUGUST TOUR

