ANGOSS Software International is proud to present SmartWare PLUS, a "STATE OF 
THE ART" application development and systems management tool set as well as a 
powerful, cross-platform integrated business automation SUITE which now operates
on the LINUX platform. This is the only business automation SUITE available on 
LINUX which contains a relational database, spreadsheet, and wordprocessor, 
complimented by a powerful programming language. 

RELATIONAL DATABASE 
The database has the flexibility to manage all types of information with up to 
two hundred million records. Features such as calculated fields and powerful 
tools like Query By Example, automatic query optimization, cross-tabulation for 
performing mathematics or tabulating figures and the ability to perform 
transactions on up to 250 files provide the features needed for successful 
database management. The built-in report generator can incorporate 127 datafiles
into a report. The database supports detailed summary and "total only" 
reporting. 

SPREADSHEET 
The spreadsheet combines minimal and background recalculation, linking and 
auditing capabilities with over 300 built-in functions, making it a powerful 
analytical tool. Each worksheet can have 10 million addressable cells.  The
spreadsheet also has an advanced business graphics module.

WORDPROCESSOR 
The wordprocessor includes cut-and-paste editing, automatic reformatting, 
search-and-replace, mailmerge, over 30 available type styles and more to let you
create professional looking documents. Comprehensive spellchecker and thesaurus,
automatic foot numbering, placement and paragraph numbering are also included. 

A free non-commercial version of SmartWare PLUS may be downloaded from 
our ftp site. (Printing and Saving features have been disabled). If you wish to 
access these features, contact ANGOSS head office at the address listed below. 

Price: $50.00US (plus applicable taxes). 

You can obtain your copy via:

	ftp.angoss.com/pub/smartware/demos/linux/SmartWare265a.tar
or,
	ftp.io.org/pub/users/angoss/linux/SmartWare265a.tar

ANGOSS SmartWare PLUS is supported on, most unix platforms (character mode or 
X11), DOS, Windows, Windows NT and Windows 95. 

ANGOSS SmartWare PLUS includes simultaneous multi-platform access. 

Developing applications with SmartWare PLUS will allow the developer to market 
and sell their application to any of the supported platforms without 
modification and in most instances without recompilation. 

Developed applications, objects, data files and documents are all platform 
independent, allowing for simultaneous multi-platform access. 

APPLICATION DEVELOPMENT 
 
ANGOSS TOOL SET (RAD) 
Cross-Platform 
ANGOSS SmartWare PLUS can run concurrently in graphics or character mode. This 
means that on a DOS/LAN, SmartWare PLUS applications can operate under Windows 
and DOS simultaneously. In a Unix environment, dumb terminals or X11 is also an 
option.  


Complete System Life Cycle Support 
SmartWare PLUS addresses the complete life span of an application from prototype
through development, support and systems management and provides a full range of
user management, organization and control tools. 

SECURITY is essential. Via an easy to use menuing structure, the tool set 
feature can limit access to any PLUS application with ease. 

Automatic Documentation 
Application Documentation is generated automatically from the help screens, 
menus, data entry screens and reports. Documentation can be produced in its 
